{"html_text": {"ja299:0.1": "<article id='ja299'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja299:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja299:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja299:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja299:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja299:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja299:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja299:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja299:4.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja299:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja299:0.2": "Tikanipāta ", "ja299:0.3": "Kumbhavagga ", "ja299:0.4": "9. Komāraputtajātaka ", "ja299:1.1": "“Pure tuvaṁ sīlavataṁ sakāse, ", "ja299:1.2": "Okkantikaṁ kīḷasi assamamhi; ", "ja299:1.3": "Karohare makkaṭiyāni makkaṭa, ", "ja299:1.4": "Na taṁ mayaṁ sīlavataṁ ramāma”. ", "ja299:2.1": "“Sutā hi mayhaṁ paramā visuddhi, ", "ja299:2.2": "Komāraputtassa bahussutassa; ", "ja299:2.3": "Mā dāni maṁ maññi tuvaṁ yathā pure, ", "ja299:2.4": "Jhānānuyutto viharāmi āvuso”. ", "ja299:3.1": "“Sacepi selasmi vapeyya bījaṁ, ", "ja299:3.2": "Devo ca vasse na hi taṁ virūḷhe; ", "ja299:3.3": "Sutā hi te sā paramā visuddhi, ", "ja299:3.4": "Ārā tuvaṁ makkaṭa jhānabhūmiyā”ti. ", "ja299:4.1": "Komāraputtajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja299:0.1": "", "ja299:0.2": "", "ja299:0.3": "", "ja299:0.4": "", "ja299:1.1": "", "ja299:1.2": "Okkantikaṁ → okkandikaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja299:1.3": "Karohare → karohi re (mr) ", "ja299:1.4": "", "ja299:2.1": "", "ja299:2.2": "Komāraputtassa → komāyaputtassa (bj, pts-vp-pli1); komāriyaputtassa (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja299:2.3": "", "ja299:2.4": "Jhānānuyutto viharāmi → jhānānuyuttā viharāma (bj); jhānābhiyuttā viharāma (sya1ed, sya2ed); jhānāniyuttā viharāma (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja299:3.1": "", "ja299:3.2": "na hi taṁ virūḷhe → neva hi taṁ ruheyya (bj, pts-vp-pli1); na hi taṁ virūhe (?) ", "ja299:3.3": "", "ja299:3.4": "", "ja299:4.1": "Komāraputtajātakaṁ → komāyaputtajātakaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); komāriyaputtajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) "}, "reference_text": {"ja299:0.1": "", "ja299:0.2": "", "ja299:0.3": "", "ja299:0.4": "", "ja299:1.1": "dr27.126, ms22J_870, msdiv145, pts-vp-pli2.448", "ja299:1.2": "", "ja299:1.3": "", "ja299:1.4": "", "ja299:2.1": "ms22J_871, msdiv146, sya27.126", "ja299:2.2": "", "ja299:2.3": "", "ja299:2.4": "", "ja299:3.1": "bj30.160, ms22J_872, msdiv147, pts-vp-pli2.449", "ja299:3.2": "", "ja299:3.3": "", "ja299:3.4": "", "ja299:4.1": "ms22J_873"}, "keys_order": ["ja299:0.1", "ja299:0.2", "ja299:0.3", "ja299:0.4", "ja299:1.1", "ja299:1.2", "ja299:1.3", "ja299:1.4", "ja299:2.1", "ja299:2.2", "ja299:2.3", "ja299:2.4", "ja299:3.1", "ja299:3.2", "ja299:3.3", "ja299:3.4", "ja299:4.1"]}